<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon's rates Jardine a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon's rates Jardine a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>It said Jardine Strategic had suffered from poor performances at Dairy Farm International Holdings Ltd because of losses from its Australian retailer, Franklins, and Kwik Save in Britain.</p>
<p>&quot;However, we believe Dairy Farm has seen the worst and a substantial rebound in earnings is expected in 1997,&quot; Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p>It said unlisted Jardine Pacific was also on the mend thanks to the decision to close 39 Sizzler restaurants in Australia, and that Hong Kong operations had been very successful in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6358</p>
</text>
